3679 0 obj
  << /ActualText (These aren\047t knowledge gaps\056 They\047re what happens when a person has been a passive recipient of other people\047s systems for long enough\056\n\nSPARK doesn\047t fix that with better instructions\056 It fixes it by changing who holds the pen\056 The elder sets the goal\056 The younger participant learns how to follow their lead\056 The facilitator\047s job is to make that handoff real \024 and then step back\056\n\nThe measure of success isn\047t whether Margaret can FaceTime her grandkids at the end of the session\056 It\047s whether she and Emma leave with a shared ritual they can return to on their own \024 one she feels entitled to initiate\056 That\047s what a system looks like\056 Not a workshop they attended\056 A dynamic they now own\056)
     /K [ 8 ]
     /P 3680 0 R
     /Pg 3272 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

